# Repository rules

- Read and follow `AGENTS.md` as the canonical policy.
- Respect architectural boundaries between `apps/`, `agents/`, `packages/`, `tools/`, `evals/`, and `infra/`.
- Do not create unapproved Markdown files or prohibited summary/completion docs.
- Do not create new top-level directories without human approval and an ADR.
- Do not create duplicate implementations named `new`, `final`, `fixed`, `v2`, or `copy`.
- Run `make check` before declaring work complete.
- Summarize work in the final response or pull-request body, never in new repository files.
